// DISHONORED(written): agent ED (PHASE11 ED). GENERATED by build/agentED/gen_classlists.py from
// resources/docs/symbols/vtables.csv (the 2012 Shipping vtables, which are the only complete record
// of retail's save virtuals: 59 classes declare IsSaveable inline as `return TRUE` and the linker
// folds all 59 onto one body, so the PDB function list names only the 11 with a real body).
//
// The object data blob is not self-delimiting: FLevelSaver::operator<<(UObject*&) writes a WORD
// dictionary index and then that object's own GameSave, inline and with no length prefix. These two
// lists are what let a partial override set be safe rather than silently wrong - the loader walks
// an object's class chain against them and stops the restore, naming the class, the moment it meets
// an object retail wrote bytes for that this tree cannot read.

